  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans:\r\rLocation Plan; Transport Impact Assessment; Flood Risk Assessment; gla-01l; gla-02l.\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "No independent cooking or laundry facilities shall be installed in any of the respective bedrooms, and the communal bathrooms and kitchen, living and dining room shall be retained as such in accordance with the approved plans in perpetuity.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r",
    "Within 3 months from the date of this decision notice, storage for 6 long stay cycle shall be provided at the rear garden of the property as required by the standards of the Council. Such facilities to be retained permanently thereafter.\r\rReason: The Council's Climate Action and Transport Policies seek to increase the use of active and sustainable transport modes. This means that access to bicycle parking should be easy and secure to remove potential barriers to cycling.\r",
    "Within 1 months from the date of this decision notice, the refuse and recycling storage hereby approved shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details and thereafter maintained unless otherwise in writing by the Local Planning Authority.\r\rReason: In the interests of amenity and the recycling of waste materials in support of the Boroughs waste reduction targets. \r",
    "The use of the property as a House in Multiple Occupation hereby approved shall be occupied by a maximum of 5 people at any one time and shall not be subdivided or occupied as self-contained units.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r"
  ],
